.TH elfshaker-esi-list 1  "elfshaker 1.0.0-rc1" "elfshaker Manual"
.SH NAME
elfshaker\-esi\-list \- Lists entries in an ESI index
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBelfshaker esi list\fR [\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIesi_file\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists entries in an ESI index
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show informational progress and diagnostic messages.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIesi_file\fR>
ESI file to list.
